AndroidX Palette attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The AndroidX-compatible palette extraction in this package follows the Android
Open Source Project's AndroidX Palette implementation at commit
81432a7d3a860faea8b18fb2a4712f1d6420f705:
https://github.com/androidx/androidx/tree/81432a7d3a860faea8b18fb2a4712f1d6420f705/palette/palette/src/main/java/androidx/palette/graphics

Specifically:

  Sources/PaletteColor/Palette.swift
      mirrors Palette.java and Target.java (default targets, scoring weights,
      DEFAULT_FILTER, default resize area and color count) and
      androidx.core.graphics.ColorUtils.RGBToHSL.

  Sources/PaletteColor/ColorCutQuantizer.swift
      mirrors ColorCutQuantizer.java (RGB555 histogram, Vbox median cut,
      average-color swatch generation).

  Sources/PaletteColor/Palette+CoreGraphics.swift
      mirrors Palette.Builder's area-based bitmap downscale
      (Bitmap.createScaledBitmap with filter = false).

